msgid "The VB program CASVB"
msgstr "VB程序CASVB"

msgid "This program can be used in two basic modes:"
msgstr "该程序可在两种基本模式下使用："

msgid ""
"variational optimization of quite general types of nonorthogonal MCSCF or "
"so-called modern valence bond wavefunctions;"
msgstr "变分优化相当一般类型的非正交MCSCF或所谓的现代价键波函数；"

msgid ""
"to generate representations of CASSCF wavefunctions in modern valence bond "
"form, using overlap- (*relatively inexpensive*) or energy-based criteria."
msgstr "使用基于重叠（\\ *相对廉价*\\ ）或基于能量的判据，以现代价键形式生成CASSCF波函数的表示。"

msgid ""
"In general, as in the spin-coupled generalized valence bond (SCGVB) "
"approach, active orbitals are expanded in the full molecular basis set "
"without locality constraints."
msgstr "通常，如同在自旋耦合广义价键（SCGVB）方法中一样，活性轨道在完整的分子基组中展开，不受定域性约束。"

msgid "Key references:"
msgstr "关键参考文献："

msgid ""
"For a review of applications of SCGVB and SCGVB(*N*,\\ *M*) calculations, "
"see: T. H. Dunning, Jr., L. T. Xu, D. L. Cooper and P. B. Karadakov, `J. "
"Phys. Chem. A <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpca.0c10472>`__ **125**, "
"2021-2050 (2021)."
msgstr ""
"关于SCGVB和SCGVB(*N*,\\ *M*)计算应用的综述，请参阅：T. H. Dunning, Jr., L. T. Xu, D. L. "
"Cooper 和 P. B. Karadakov, `J. Phys. Chem. A "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpca.0c10472>`__ **125**, 2021-2050 (2021)。"

msgid "Structure of the input"
msgstr "输入结构"

msgid ""
"Most *CASVB* sub-commands may be abbreviated by four letters. The general "
"input structure can be summarized as follows:"
msgstr "大多数 *CASVB* 子命令可以用四个字母缩写。通用输入结构可总结如下："

msgid ""
"For generating representations of CASSCF wavefunctions, the program is "
"invoked by the command ``CASVB``. For variational optimization of "
"wavefunctions it is normally invoked inside *MULTI* by the sub-command "
"``VB`` (see `optimizing valence bond wavefunctions "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#optimizing-valence-bond-wavefunctions>`__)."
msgstr ""
"为生成CASSCF波函数的表示，程序通过命令 ``CASVB`` 调用。为进行波函数的变分优化，通常通过子命令 ``VB`` 在 *MULTI* "
"内部调用（参见 `优化价键波函数 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#optimizing-valence-bond-"
"wavefunctions>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "Definition of the CASSCF wavefunction (not generally required)."
msgstr "CASSCF 波函数的定义（通常不需要）。"

msgid "Definition of the valence bond wavefunction."
msgstr "价键波函数的定义。"

msgid "Recovery and/or storage of orbitals and vectors."
msgstr "轨道和向量的恢复和/或存储。"

msgid "Manual input of starting guess (optional)."
msgstr "初始猜测的手动输入（可选）。"

msgid "Optimization control."
msgstr "优化控制。"

msgid ""
"Definition of molecular symmetry and possible constraints on the VB "
"wavefunction."
msgstr "分子对称性的定义以及对 VB 波函数可能的约束。"

msgid "Wavefunction analysis."
msgstr "波函数分析。"

msgid "Further general options."
msgstr "其他通用选项。"

msgid ""
"Items a) and b) should precede everything else in the input; apart from "
"this, commands may come in any order."
msgstr "项目 a) 和 b) 应位于输入中的所有其他内容之前；除此之外，命令可以按任意顺序出现。"

msgid "Defining the CASSCF wavefunction"
msgstr "定义 CASSCF 波函数"

msgid ""
"When *MULTI* is run prior to *CASVB*, the CI vector must dumped using one of"
" the directives ``SAVE, NATORB, CANONICAL,`` or ``LOCALI`` (see section "
"`saving the CI vectors and information for a gradient calculation "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors-and-information-for-a-"
"gradient-calculation>`__). The three latter are recommended. Note that "
"*CASVB* relies on the determinant part of *MULTI*. This means that when "
"*MULTI* is run prior to *CASVB*, ``CONFIG,DET;`` should be used, whereas "
"``CONFIG,CSF;`` must *not* be."
msgstr ""
"如果在 *CASVB* 之前运行 *MULTI*\\ ，则必须使用指令 ``SAVE, NATORB, CANONICAL,`` 或 "
"``LOCALI`` 之一转储 CI 向量（参见章节 `保存 CI 向量和梯度计算信息 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors-and-information-for-a-"
"gradient-calculation>`__\\ ）。推荐使用后三者。请注意，\\ *CASVB* 依赖于 *MULTI* "
"的行列式部分。这意味着，如果在 *CASVB* 之前运行 *MULTI*\\ ，则应使用 ``CONFIG,DET;``\\ ，而 "
"``CONFIG,CSF;`` 则\\ *不得*\\ 使用。"

msgid "The VBDUMP directive"
msgstr "VBDUMP 指令"

msgid ""
"If present, the ``VBDUMP`` card must occur first in the *CASVB* input. It is"
" *not* required for variational calculations."
msgstr "如果存在，\\ ``VBDUMP`` 卡片必须出现在 *CASVB* 输入的最前面。对于变分计算，它\\ *不是*\\ 必需的。"

msgid ""
"Note that in the majority of cases (*e.g.*, if a *CASVB* run occurs "
"immediately after *MULTI*, or for variational calculations), explicit "
"specification of dump records with *vbdump* is not required."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在大多数情况下（\\ *例如*\\ ，如果 *CASVB* 运行紧接在 *MULTI* 之后，或对于变分计算），不需要使用 *vbdump* "
"显式指定转储记录。"

msgid "Other wavefunction directives"
msgstr "其他波函数指令"

msgid ""
"The definitions of the CASSCF wavefunction may also be specified manually "
"using some or all of the directives:"
msgstr "CASSCF波函数的定义也可以使用部分或全部以下指令手动指定："

msgid "``OCC`` Occupied orbitals."
msgstr "``OCC`` 占据轨道。"

msgid "``CLOSED`` Closed-shell orbitals."
msgstr "``CLOSED`` 闭壳层轨道。"

msgid "``FROZEN`` Frozen-core orbitals."
msgstr "``FROZEN`` 冻结芯轨道。"

msgid "``WF`` Wavefunction card."
msgstr "``WF`` 波函数卡。"

msgid "``STATE`` Number of states for this wavefunction symmetry."
msgstr "``STATE`` 此波函数对称性的态数。"

msgid "``WEIGHT`` Weights of states."
msgstr "``WEIGHT`` 态的权重。"

msgid ""
"For the exact definition of these cards see sections `defining the orbital "
"subspaces <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#defining-the-orbital-subspaces>`__ "
"and `defining the optimized states <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#defining-"
"the-optimized-states>`__. These commands may also be used to modify the "
"values defined in ``VBDUMP``. The information given on these cards should "
"correspond to the CI vector saved in the CASSCF calculation. The cards, and "
"their ordering, should therefore coincide with those used in *MULTI*, except"
" for the ``WEIGHT`` cards which may differ. At present, the VB wavefunction "
"must correspond to a well-defined number of electrons and total spin. Other "
"states may be present, but an error condition will occur if non-zero weights"
" are specified for wavefunction symmetries with varying values of *elec* or "
"*spin*."
msgstr ""
"关于这些卡片的精确定义，请参阅章节 `定义轨道子空间 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#defining-the-"
"orbital-subspaces>`__ 和 `定义优化态 <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#defining-the-"
"optimized-states>`__\\ 。这些命令也可用于修改在 ``VBDUMP`` 中定义的值。这些卡片上提供的信息应与 CASSCF "
"计算中保存的 CI 向量相对应。因此，这些卡片及其顺序应与 *MULTI* 中使用的卡片一致，但 ``WEIGHT`` 卡片可能有所不同。目前，VB "
"波函数必须对应于一个明确定义的电子数和总自旋。其他态可能存在，但如果为具有不同 *elec* 或 *spin* "
"值的波函数对称性指定了非零权重，则会发生错误条件。"

msgid "Defining the valence bond wavefunction"
msgstr "定义价键波函数"

msgid "Specifying orbital configurations"
msgstr "指定轨道组态"

msgid ""
"The number of core and active orbitals (:math:`mcore`, :math:`mact`), active"
" electrons (:math:`Nact`), and the value of the total spin will be identical"
" to that defined for the CASSCF wavefunction. The spatial VB configurations "
"are defined in terms of the active orbitals only, and may be specified using"
" one or more ``CON`` cards (note that the ``RESTRICT`` and ``SELECT`` "
"keywords are not used in *CASVB*):"
msgstr ""
"核心和活性轨道的数量 (:math:`mcore`, :math:`mact`)、活性电子数 (:math:`Nact`) 以及总自旋的值将与为 "
"CASSCF 波函数定义的值相同。空间 VB 组态仅根据活性轨道定义，并且可以使用一个或多个 ``CON`` 卡片来指定（请注意，\\ *CASVB* "
"中不使用 ``RESTRICT`` 和 ``SELECT`` 关键字）："

msgid ""
"The configurations can be specified by occupation numbers, exactly as in "
"*MULTI* (see section `specifying orbital configurations "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#specifying-orbital-configurations>`__), so "
"that :math:`n_i` is the occupation of the :math:`i`\\ th valence bond "
"orbital. Alternatively a list of :math:`Nact` orbital numbers (in any order)"
" may be provided – the program determines which definition applies. The two "
"cards ``CON,1,0,1,2;`` and ``CON,1,3,4,4;`` are thus equivalent."
msgstr ""
"组态可以通过占据数来指定，与 *MULTI* 中完全相同（参见章节 `指定轨道组态 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#specifying-orbital-configurations>`__\\ ），因此 "
":math:`n_i` 是第 :math:`i` 个价键轨道的占据数。或者，可以提供 :math:`Nact` "
"个轨道编号的列表（以任意顺序）——程序会判断适用哪种定义。因此，卡片 ``CON,1,0,1,2;`` 和 ``CON,1,3,4,4;`` 是等价的。"

msgid ""
"If no configurations are specified the single covalent configuration "
":math:`\\phi_1\\phi_2\\cdots\\phi_{Nact}` is assumed (SCGVB wavefunction)."
msgstr "如果未指定任何组态，则假定为单一共价组态 :math:`\\phi_1\\phi_2\\cdots\\phi_{Nact}`\\ （SCGVB 波函数）。"

msgid "Selecting the spin basis"
msgstr "选择自旋基"

msgid "Recovering CASSCF CI vector and VB wavefunction"
msgstr "恢复 CASSCF CI 向量和 VB 波函数"

msgid ""
"The appropriate Molpro records may be specified explicitly using the "
"``START`` directive (an alternative is the *vbdump* mechanism described in "
"section `the VBDUMP directive <the_vb_program_casvb.html#the-vbdump-"
"directive>`__):"
msgstr ""
"可以使用 ``START`` 指令明确指定相应的 Molpro 记录（另一种方法是使用 `the VBDUMP directive "
"<the_vb_program_casvb.html#the-vbdump-directive>`__ 章节中描述的 *vbdump* 机制）："

msgid ""
"Note that if the *ci* record is not found, only an energy-based optimization"
" of the VB wavefunction can be carried out."
msgstr "请注意，如果未找到 *ci* 记录，则只能执行基于能量的 VB 波函数优化。"

msgid ""
"*vb:* record name for the valence bond orbitals and structure coefficients, "
"as saved by a previous CASVB calculation. If the VB wavefunction was "
"previously saved in the AO basis the orbitals will be projected onto the "
"present active space (note that it is necessary to specify a record name for"
" the molecular orbitals (*orb* below) for this to be possible)."
msgstr ""
"*vb:* 价键轨道和结构系数的记录名，由先前的 CASVB 计算保存。如果 VB "
"波函数先前以原子轨道基组保存，轨道将被投影到当前的活性空间（注意，为此需要为分子轨道指定一个记录名（见下面的 *orb*\\ ））。"

msgid ""
"*orb:* record name for the molecular orbitals defining the CASSCF "
"wavefunction. This information is necessary if one wants to output the "
"valence bond orbitals in the atomic orbital basis."
msgstr "*orb:* 定义 CASSCF 波函数的分子轨道的记录名。如果想要以原子轨道基组输出价键轨道，此信息是必需的。"

msgid ""
"*trnint:* record name for the transformed CASSCF integrals. These are "
"required for the energy-based criteria (i.e., if ``CRIT,ENERGY`` is "
"specified), and can be saved inside *MULTI* by the ``TRNINT`` sub-command "
"(see `saving transformed integrals <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-"
"transformed-integrals>`__). The default record name, both here and in "
"*MULTI*, is 1900.1."
msgstr ""
"*trnint:* 变换后的 CASSCF 积分的记录名。这些是能量判据（即，如果指定了 ``CRIT,ENERGY``\\ ）所必需的，并且可以通过 "
"``TRNINT`` 子命令在 *MULTI* 内部保存（参见 `保存变换积分 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-transformed-integrals>`__\\ ）。此处和在 "
"*MULTI* 中的默认记录名都是 1900.1。"

msgid "Saving the VB wavefunction"
msgstr "保存 VB 波函数"

msgid ""
"*vb:* record name for VB wavefunction (default is first available record "
"after 3200.2), i.e., orbitals and structure coefficients."
msgstr "*vb:* VB 波函数的记录名（默认为 3200.2 之后第一个可用的记录），即轨道和结构系数。"

msgid ""
"*civb:* record name for valence bond full CI vector defined in terms of the "
"CASSCF MOs (default is 3300.2). Saving this vector is necessary for the "
"calculation of further properties, geometry optimization, etc."
msgstr ""
"*civb:* 以 CASSCF 分子轨道定义的价键全组态相互作用向量的记录名（默认为 "
"3300.2）。保存此向量对于计算进一步的性质、几何优化等是必需的。"

msgid "It is normally advisable to use records on file 2 for *vb* and *civb*."
msgstr "通常建议对 *vb* 和 *civb* 使用文件 2 上的记录。"

msgid "Specifying a guess"
msgstr "指定初猜"

msgid ""
"The ``GUESS`` keyword initiates the input of a guess for the valence bond "
"orbitals and structure coefficients. *key-i* can be either ``ORB``, "
"``STRUC`` or ``READ``. These keywords modify the guess provided by the "
"program, or specified by the ``START`` directive. It is thus possible to "
"modify individual orbitals in a previous solution to construct the starting "
"guess."
msgstr ""
"``GUESS`` 关键字启动对价键轨道和结构系数的初猜输入。\\ *key-i* 可以是 ``ORB``\\ 、\\ ``STRUC`` 或 "
"``READ``\\ 。这些关键字修改程序提供的初猜，或由 ``START`` 指令指定的初猜。因此，可以修改先前解中的单个轨道来构建起始初猜。"

msgid "Orbital guess"
msgstr "轨道初猜"

msgid ""
"Specifies a starting guess for valence bond orbital number :math:`i`. The "
"guess is specified in terms of the :math:`mact` active MOs defining the "
"CASSCF wavefunction. (Note that the definition of these MOs will depend on "
"how the CI vector was dumped – i.e. which of the ``SAVE, NATORB, "
"CANONICAL,`` or ``LOCALI`` directives was used (see section `saving the CI "
"vectors and information for a gradient calculation "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors-and-information-for-a-"
"gradient-calculation>`__). Use of one of the three latter keywords is "
"recommended.)"
msgstr ""
"指定价键轨道编号 :math:`i` 的初始猜测。该猜测是根据定义 CASSCF 波函数的 :math:`mact` 个活性 MO "
"来指定的。（请注意，这些 MO 的定义取决于 CI 向量是如何转储的——即使用了 ``SAVE, NATORB, CANONICAL,`` 或 "
"``LOCALI`` 指令中的哪一个（参见章节 `保存 CI 向量和梯度计算信息 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors-and-information-for-a-"
"gradient-calculation>`__\\ ）。建议使用后三个关键词之一。）"

msgid "Guess for structure coefficients"
msgstr "结构系数猜测"

msgid ""
"Specifies a starting guess for the :math:`NVB` structure coefficients. If "
"this card is not provided, and no guess specified by ``START``, the perfect-"
"pairing mode of spin coupling is assumed for the spatial configuration "
"having the least number of doubly occupied orbitals. Note that the "
"definition of structures depends on the value of ``SPINBASIS``. Doubly "
"occupied orbitals occur first in all configurations, and the spin "
"eigenfunctions are based on the singly occupied orbitals being in ascending "
"order."
msgstr ""
"为 :math:`NVB` 个结构系数指定一个初始猜测。如果未提供此卡片，且未通过 ``START`` "
"指定猜测，则假定为具有最少双占据轨道数的空间构型采用完美配对的自旋耦合模式。请注意，结构的定义取决于 ``SPINBASIS`` "
"的值。在所有构型中，双占据轨道首先出现，并且自旋本征函数基于按升序排列的单占据轨道。"

msgid "Read orbitals or structure coefficients"
msgstr "读取轨道或结构系数"

msgid "The ``READ`` keyword can take one of the following forms:"
msgstr "``READ`` 关键字可以采用以下形式之一："

msgid ""
"``READ``,\\ ``ORB``,\\ *iorb1*\\ [,\\ ``TO``,\\ *iorb2*] [,\\ ``AS``,\\ "
"*jorb1*\\ [,\\ ``TO``,\\ *jorb2*]] [,\\ ``FROM``,\\ *record*];"
msgstr ""
"``READ``,\\ ``ORB``,\\ *iorb1*\\ [,\\ ``TO``,\\ *iorb2*] [,\\ ``AS``,\\ "
"*jorb1*\\ [,\\ ``TO``,\\ *jorb2*]] [,\\ ``FROM``,\\ *record*];"

msgid ""
"``READ``,\\ ``STRUC``,\\ *istruc1*\\ [,\\ ``TO``,\\ *istruc2*] [,\\ "
"``AS``,\\ *jstruc1*\\ [,\\ ``TO``,\\ *jstruc2*]] [,\\ ``FROM``,\\ *record*];"
msgstr ""
"``READ``,\\ ``STRUC``,\\ *istruc1*\\ [,\\ ``TO``,\\ *istruc2*] [,\\ "
"``AS``,\\ *jstruc1*\\ [,\\ ``TO``,\\ *jstruc2*]] [,\\ ``FROM``,\\ *record*];"

msgid "``READ``,\\ ``ALL`` [,\\ ``FROM``,\\ *record*];"
msgstr "``READ``,\\ ``ALL`` [,\\ ``FROM``,\\ *record*];"

msgid ""
"Default for *record* is the *vb* record name specified in keyword ``START`` "
"(if applicable)."
msgstr "*record* 的默认值是关键字 ``START`` 中指定的 *vb* 记录名（如果适用）。"

msgid "Permuting orbitals"
msgstr "轨道置换"

msgid ""
"Permutes the orbitals in the valence bond wavefunction and changes their "
"phases according to :math:`\\phi_j'={\\rm sign}(i_j)\\phi_{{\\rm "
"abs}(i_j)}`. The guess may be further modified using the ``GUESS`` keyword. "
"Also the structure coefficients will be transformed according to the given "
"permutation (note that the configuration list must be closed under the "
"orbital permutation for this to be possible)."
msgstr ""
"置换价键波函数中的轨道，并根据 :math:`\\phi_j'={\\rm sign}(i_j)\\phi_{{\\rm abs}(i_j)}` "
"改变其相位。可使用 ``GUESS`` "
"关键字进一步修改初始猜测。结构系数也将根据给定的置换进行变换（注意，配置列表必须在轨道置换下闭合才能实现此操作）。"

msgid "Optimization control"
msgstr "优化控制"

msgid "Optimization criterion"
msgstr "优化判据"

msgid ""
"Specifies the criterion for the optimization. *method* can be ``OVERLAP`` or"
" ``ENERGY`` (``OVERLAP`` is default). The former maximizes the normalized "
"overlap with the CASSCF wavefunction:"
msgstr ""
"指定优化的判据。\\ *method* 可以是 ``OVERLAP`` 或 ``ENERGY``\\ （默认为 ``OVERLAP``\\ "
"）。前者最大化与 CASSCF 波函数的归一化重叠："

msgid ""
"{\\rm "
"max}\\left(\\frac{\\langle\\Psi_{CAS}|\\Psi_{VB}\\rangle}{(\\langle\\Psi_{VB}|\\Psi_{VB}\\rangle)^{1/2}}\\right)"
msgstr ""
"{\\rm max}\\left(\\frac{\\langle\\Psi_{CAS}|\\Psi_{VB}\\rangle}{(\\langle\\Psi_{VB}|\\Psi_{VB}\\rangle)^{1/2}}\\right)\n"
"\n"

msgid "and the latter simply minimizes the energy:"
msgstr "而后者则简单地最小化能量："

msgid ""
"{\\rm "
"min}\\left(\\frac{\\langle\\Psi_{VB}|\\hat{H}|\\Psi_{VB}\\rangle}{\\langle\\Psi_{VB}|\\Psi_{VB}\\rangle}\\right)."
msgstr ""
"{\\rm min}\\left(\\frac{\\langle\\Psi_{VB}|\\hat{H}|\\Psi_{VB}\\rangle}{\\langle\\Psi_{VB}|\\Psi_{VB}\\rangle}\\right).\n"
"\n"

msgid "Number of iterations"
msgstr "迭代次数"

msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum number of iterations in the second order "
"optimizations. Default is :math:`N_{iter}`\\ =50."
msgstr "指定二阶优化中的最大迭代次数。默认值为 :math:`N_{iter}`\\ =50。"

msgid "CASSCF-projected structure coefficients"
msgstr "CASSCF 投影的结构系数"

msgid ""
"With this keyword the structure coefficients are picked from the transformed"
" CASSCF CI vector, leaving only the orbital variational parameters. For "
"further details see the bibliography. This option may be useful to aid "
"convergence."
msgstr "使用此关键字，结构系数将从变换后的 CASSCF CI 向量中选取，仅保留轨道变分参数。更多细节请参阅参考文献。此选项可能有助于促进收敛。"

msgid "Saddle-point optimization"
msgstr "鞍点优化"

msgid ""
"Defines optimization onto an *n*\\ :math:`^{\\rm th}`-order saddle point. "
"See also T. Thorsteinsson and D. L. Cooper, `Int. J. Quant. Chem. "
"<http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/%28SICI%291097-461X%281998%2970%3A4/5%3C637%3A%3AAID-"
"QUA10%3E3.0.CO%3B2-%23>`__ **70**, 637–650 (1998)."
msgstr ""
"定义优化至一个 *n*\\ :math:`^{\\rm th}` 阶鞍点。另请参阅 T. Thorsteinsson 和 D. L. Cooper, "
"`Int. J. Quant. Chem. "
"<http://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/abs/10.1002/%28SICI%291097-461X%281998%2970%3A4/5%3C637%3A%3AAID-"
"QUA10%3E3.0.CO%3B2-%23>`__ **70**, 637–650 (1998)。"

msgid "Defining several optimizations"
msgstr "定义多个优化"

msgid ""
"More than one optimization may be performed in the same *CASVB* deck, by the"
" use of ``OPTIM`` keywords:"
msgstr "可以在同一个 *CASVB* 输入组中通过使用 ``OPTIM`` 关键字执行多个优化："

msgid ""
"The subcommands may be any optimization declarations defined in this "
"section, as well as any symmetry or constraints specifications described in "
"section `point group symmetry and constraints "
"<the_vb_program_casvb.html#point-group-symmetry-and-constraints>`__. "
"Commands given as arguments to ``OPTIM`` will be particular to this "
"optimization step, whereas commands specified outside will act as default "
"definitions for all subsequent ``OPTIM`` keywords."
msgstr ""
"子命令可以是本节定义的任何优化声明，以及章节 `点群对称性与约束 <the_vb_program_casvb.html#point-group-"
"symmetry-and-constraints>`__ 中描述的任何对称性或约束规范。作为 ``OPTIM`` "
"参数给出的命令将特定于此优化步长，而在外部指定的命令将作为所有后续 ``OPTIM`` 关键字的默认定义。"

msgid ""
"If only one optimization step is required, the ``OPTIM`` keyword need not be"
" specified."
msgstr "如果只需要一个优化步长，则无需指定 ``OPTIM`` 关键字。"

msgid ""
"When only a machine-generated guess is available, *CASVB* will attempt to "
"define a sequence of optimization steps chosen such as to maximize the "
"likelihood of successful convergence and to minimize CPU usage. This default"
" behaviour corresponds to specifying the keyword ``INIT`` and it can be "
"overridden by specifying the keyword ``NOINIT``. Alternatively, specify one "
"or more ``OPTIM`` cards."
msgstr ""
"当只有机器生成的初始猜测可用时，\\ *CASVB* "
"将尝试定义一系列优化步长，其选择旨在最大化成功收敛的可能性并最小化CPU使用率。此默认行为对应于指定关键字 ``INIT``\\ "
"，并且可以通过指定关键字 ``NOINIT`` 来覆盖。或者，指定一个或多个 ``OPTIM`` 卡片。"

msgid "Multi-step optimization"
msgstr "多步优化"

msgid "A loop over two or more optimization steps may be specified using:"
msgstr "可以使用以下方式指定对两个或更多优化步长的循环："

msgid ""
"With this specification the program will repeat the enclosed optimization "
"steps until either all optimizations have converged, or the maximum "
"iteration count, *Niter*, has been reached."
msgstr "通过此规范，程序将重复执行所包含的优化步长，直到所有优化都已收敛，或者达到最大迭代次数 *Niter*\\ 。"

msgid "Point group symmetry and constraints"
msgstr "点群对称性与约束"

msgid ""
"The problems associated with symmetry-adapting valence bond wavefunctions "
"are considered, for example, in: T. Thorsteinsson, D. L. Cooper, J. Gerratt "
"and M. Raimondi, `Theor. Chim. Acta "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/BF02341697>`__ **95**, 131-150 (1997)."
msgstr ""
"与对称化价键波函数相关的问题，例如在以下文献中有所讨论：T. Thorsteinsson, D. L. Cooper, J. Gerratt and "
"M. Raimondi, `Theor. Chim. Acta <https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/BF02341697>`__ "
"**95**, 131-150 (1997)。"

msgid "Symmetry operations"
msgstr "对称操作"

msgid ""
"Initiates the definition of a symmetry operation referred to by *label* (any"
" three characters). *sign* can be + or :math:`-`; it specifies whether the "
"total wavefunction is symmetric or antisymmetric under this operation, "
"respectively. A value for *sign* is not always necessary but, if provided, "
"constraints will be put on the structure coefficients to ensure that the "
"wavefunction has the correct overall symmetry (note that the configuration "
"list must be closed under the orbital permutation induced by *label* for "
"this to be possible)."
msgstr ""
"初始化由 *label*\\ （任意三个字符）引用的对称操作的定义。\\ *sign* 可以是 + 或 :math:`-`\\ "
"；它分别指定总波函数在此操作下是对称的还是反对称的。\\ *sign* "
"的值并非总是必需的，但如果提供了，将对结构系数施加约束，以确保波函数具有正确的整体对称性（注意，配置列表必须在由 *label* "
"诱导的轨道置换下闭合，这才可能实现）。"

msgid ""
"The operator is defined in terms of its action on the active MOs as "
"specified by one or more of the keywords ``IRREPS``, ``COEFFS``, or "
"``TRANS`` (any other keyword will terminate the definition of this symmetry "
"operator). If no further keyword is supplied, the identity is assumed for "
"*label*. The alternative format ``SYMELM``,\\ *label*,\\ *sign*;\\ "
"*key-1,…*; *key-2,…*;…may also be used."
msgstr ""
"该算符根据其对活性 MO 的作用来定义，具体由关键字 ``IRREPS``\\ 、\\ ``COEFFS`` 或 ``TRANS`` "
"中的一个或多个指定（任何其他关键字将终止此对称算符的定义）。如果没有提供进一步的关键字，则假定 *label* 为恒等算符。也可以使用替代格式 "
"``SYMELM``,\\ *label*,\\ *sign*;\\ *key-1,…*; *key-2,…*;…。"

msgid "The IRREPS keyword"
msgstr "IRREPS 关键字"

msgid "The COEFFS keyword"
msgstr "COEFFS 关键字"

msgid "The TRANS keyword"
msgstr "TRANS 关键字"

msgid "Symmetry relations between orbitals"
msgstr "轨道间的对称关系"

msgid ""
"In general, for a VB wavefunction to be symmetry-pure, the orbitals must "
"form a representation (not necessarily irreducible) of the symmetry group. "
"Relations between orbitals under the symmetry operations defined by "
"``SYMELM`` may be specified according to:"
msgstr ""
"通常，为了使 VB 波函数具有纯对称性，轨道必须构成对称群的一个表示（不一定是不可约的）。在由 ``SYMELM`` "
"定义的对称操作下，轨道之间的关系可以按照以下方式指定："

msgid ""
"Orbital :math:`i_1` is related to orbital :math:`i_2` by the sequence of "
"operations defined by the *label* specifications (defined previously using "
"``SYMELM``). The operators operate right to left. Note that :math:`i_1` and "
":math:`i_2` may coincide. Only the minimum number of relations required to "
"define all the orbitals should be provided; an error exit will occur if "
"redundant ``ORBREL`` specifications are found."
msgstr ""
"轨道 :math:`i_1` 通过由 *label* 规范（先前使用 ``SYMELM`` 定义）定义的操作序列与轨道 :math:`i_2` "
"相关联。操作符从右向左作用。注意 :math:`i_1` 和 :math:`i_2` 可能重合。应仅提供定义所有轨道所需的最少关系数；如果发现冗余的 "
"``ORBREL`` 规范，将导致错误退出。"

msgid "The SYMPROJ keyword"
msgstr "SYMPROJ 关键字"

msgid ""
"As an alternative to incorporating constraints, one may also ensure correct "
"symmetry of the wavefunction by use of a projection operator:"
msgstr "作为加入约束的替代方案，也可以通过使用投影算符来确保波函数的正确对称性："

msgid ""
"The effect of this keyword is to set to zero coefficients in unwanted "
"irreducible representations. For this purpose the symmetry group defined for"
" the CASSCF wavefunction is used (always a subgroup of D\\ :math:`_{2h}`). "
"The list of irreps in the command specifies which components of the "
"wavefunction should be kept. If no irreducible representations are given, "
"the current wavefunction symmetry is assumed. In a state-averaged "
"calculation, all irreps are retained for which a non-zero weight has been "
"specified in the wavefunction definition. The ``SYMPROJ`` keyword may also "
"be used in combination with constraints."
msgstr ""
"此关键字的作用是将不需要的不可约表示中的系数设为零。为此，使用为 CASSCF 波函数定义的对称群（始终是 D\\ :math:`_{2h}` "
"的子群）。命令中的不可约表示列表指定应保留波函数的哪些分量。如果未给出不可约表示，则假定为当前波函数对称性。在态平均计算中，将保留所有在波函数定义中指定了非零权重的不可约表示。\\"
" ``SYMPROJ`` 关键字也可以与约束结合使用。"

msgid "Freezing orbitals in the optimization"
msgstr "优化中冻结轨道"

msgid ""
"Freezes the specified orbitals to be those in the starting guess. "
"Alternatively the special keywords ``ALL`` or ``NONE`` may be used. These "
"orbitals are eliminated from the optimization procedure, but will still be "
"normalized and symmetry-adapted according to any ``ORBREL`` keywords given."
msgstr ""
"将指定的轨道冻结为初始猜测中的轨道。或者，可以使用特殊关键字 ``ALL`` 或 ``NONE``\\ "
"。这些轨道将从优化过程中排除，但仍会根据任何给定的 ``ORBREL`` 关键字进行归一化和对称性适配。"

msgid "Freezing structure coefficients in the optimization"
msgstr "优化中冻结结构系数"

msgid ""
"Freezes the coefficients for the specified structures to be those in the "
"starting guess. Alternatively the special keywords ``ALL`` or ``NONE`` may "
"be used. The structures are eliminated from the optimization procedure, but "
"may still be affected by normalization or any symmetry keywords present."
msgstr ""
"将指定结构的系数冻结为初始猜测值。或者，可以使用特殊关键字 ``ALL`` 或 ``NONE``\\ "
"。这些结构将从优化过程中移除，但仍可能受到归一化或任何存在的对称性关键字的影响。"

msgid "Deleting structures from the optimization"
msgstr "从优化中删除结构"

msgid ""
"Deletes the specified structures from the wavefunction. The special keywords"
" ``ALL`` or ``NONE`` may be used. A structure coefficient may already be "
"zero by symmetry (as defined by ``SYMELM`` and ``ORBREL``), in which case "
"deleting it has no effect."
msgstr ""
"从波函数中删除指定的结构。可以使用特殊关键字 ``ALL`` 或 ``NONE``\\ 。结构系数可能已因对称性（由 ``SYMELM`` 和 "
"``ORBREL`` 定义）而为零，在这种情况下，删除它没有效果。"

msgid "Orthogonality constraints"
msgstr "正交性约束"

msgid ""
"The ``ORTHCON`` keyword initiates the input of orthogonality constraints "
"between pairs of valence bond orbitals. The sub-keywords *key-i* can be one "
"of ``ORTH``, ``PAIRS``, ``GROUP``, ``STRONG`` or ``FULL`` as described "
"below. Orthogonality constraints should be used with discretion. Note that "
"orthogonality constraints for an orbital generated from another by symmetry "
"operations (using the ``ORBREL`` keyword) cannot in general be satisfied."
msgstr ""
"``ORTHCON`` 关键字启动对价键轨道对之间正交性约束的输入。子关键字 *key-i* 可以是 ``ORTH``\\ 、\\ "
"``PAIRS``\\ 、\\ ``GROUP``\\ 、\\ ``STRONG`` 或 ``FULL`` "
"之一，如下所述。应谨慎使用正交性约束。请注意，对于通过对称操作（使用 ``ORBREL`` 关键字）从另一个轨道生成的轨道，其正交性约束通常无法满足。"

msgid ""
"Specifies a list of orbitals to be orthogonalized. All overlaps between "
"pairs of orbitals in the list are set to zero."
msgstr "指定一个待正交化的轨道列表。列表中所有轨道对之间的重叠积分均设为零。"

msgid ""
"Specifies a simple list of orthogonalization pairs. Orbital :math:`i_1` is "
"made orthogonal to :math:`i_2`, :math:`i_3` to :math:`i_4`, etc."
msgstr ""
"指定一个简单的正交化对列表。轨道 :math:`i_1` 与 :math:`i_2` 正交，\\ :math:`i_3` 与 :math:`i_4` "
"正交，依此类推。"

msgid ""
"This keyword is short-hand for full orthogonality. This is mainly likely to "
"be useful for testing purposes."
msgstr "此关键字是“完全正交性”的简写。这主要用于测试目的。"

msgid "Wavefunction analysis"
msgstr "波函数分析"

msgid "Spin correlation analysis"
msgstr "自旋关联分析"

msgid ""
"This analysis has been implemented only for single configurations of singly-"
"occupied active orbitals (as in SCGVB wavefunctions)."
msgstr "此分析仅针对单占据活性轨道的单组态（如在 SCGVB 波函数中）实现。"

msgid "Printing weights of the valence bond structures"
msgstr "打印价键结构的权重"

msgid ""
"For further details regarding the calculation of weights in *CASVB*, see T. "
"Thorsteinsson and D. L. Cooper, `J. Math. Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1023/A:1019100703879>`__ **23**, 105-126 (1998)."
msgstr ""
"关于 *CASVB* 中权重计算的更多细节，请参阅 T. Thorsteinsson 和 D. L. Cooper 的论文 `J. Math. "
"Chem. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1023/A:1019100703879>`__ **23**, 105-126 "
"(1998)。"

msgid ""
"Calculates and outputs weights of the structures in the valence bond "
"wavefunction :math:`\\Psi_{VB}`. *key* specifies the definition of "
"nonorthogonal weights to be used, and can be one of:"
msgstr "计算并输出价键波函数 :math:`\\Psi_{VB}` 中结构的权重。\\ *key* 指定要使用的非正交权重的定义，可以是以下之一："

msgid ""
"``CHIRGWIN`` Evaluates Chirgwin-Coulson weights (see: B. H. Chirgwin and C. "
"A. Coulson, `Proc. Roy. Soc. Lond. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1098/rspa.1950.0053>`__ **A201**, 196 (1950))."
msgstr ""
"``CHIRGWIN`` 计算 Chirgwin-Coulson 权重（参见：B. H. Chirgwin 和 C. A. Coulson, "
"`Proc. Roy. Soc. Lond. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1098/rspa.1950.0053>`__ "
"**A201**, 196 (1950)）。"

msgid ""
"``LOWDIN`` Performs a symmetric orthogonalization of the structures and "
"outputs the corresponding weights."
msgstr "``LOWDIN`` 对结构进行对称正交化并输出相应的权重。"

msgid "``ALL`` All of the above."
msgstr "``ALL`` 以上所有。"

msgid "``NONE`` Suspends calculation of structure weights."
msgstr "``NONE`` 暂停结构权重的计算。"

msgid ""
"The commands ``LOWDIN`` and ``INVERSE`` require the overlap matrix between "
"valence bond structures, and thus some additional computational overhead is "
"involved."
msgstr "命令 ``LOWDIN`` 和 ``INVERSE`` 需要价键结构之间的重叠矩阵，因此会涉及一些额外的计算开销。"

msgid "Printing weights of the CASSCF wavefunction in the VB basis"
msgstr "在VB基组中打印CASSCF波函数的权重"

msgid ""
"Prints weights of the CASSCF wavefunction transformed to the basis of "
"nonorthogonal VB structures. For the *key* options see ``VBWEIGHTS`` above. "
"Note that the evaluation of inverse overlap weights involves an extensive "
"computational overhead for large active spaces. Weights are given for the "
"total CASSCF wavefunction, as well as the orthogonal complement to "
":math:`\\Psi_{VB}`. The default for the number of configurations requested, "
":math:`N_{\\rm conf}`, is 10. If :math:`N_{\\rm conf}`\\ =\\ :math:`-1` all "
"configurations are included."
msgstr ""
"打印转换到非正交VB结构基组下的CASSCF波函数权重。关于 *key* 选项，请参见上面的 ``VBWEIGHTS``\\ "
"。请注意，对于大的活性空间，计算逆重叠权重会涉及大量的计算开销。权重会同时给出总CASSCF波函数以及 :math:`\\Psi_{VB}` "
"的正交补空间的权重。请求的组态数 :math:`N_{\\rm conf}` 的默认值为10。如果 :math:`N_{\\rm conf}`\\ "
"=\\ :math:`-1`\\ ，则包含所有组态。"

msgid "Controlling the amount of output"
msgstr "控制输出量"

msgid ""
"Each number specifies the level of output required at various stages of the "
"execution, according to the following convention:"
msgstr "每个数字根据以下约定，指定了执行各个阶段所需的输出级别："

msgid "**-1** No output except serious, or fatal, error messages."
msgstr "**-1** 除严重或致命错误信息外，无输出。"

msgid "The areas for which output can be controlled are:"
msgstr "可控制输出的区域包括："

msgid "Further facilities"
msgstr "其他功能"

msgid ""
"Calculations can also be performed for various types of direct product "
"wavefunctions and/or with strictly localized orbitals. Details are available"
" from the authors. These facilities will be documented in a later release."
msgstr "计算也可以针对各种类型的直积波函数和/或使用严格定域轨道进行。详情可向作者索取。这些功能将在后续版本中记录。"

msgid "Service mode"
msgstr "服务模式"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid ""
"*CASVB* is a general program for valence bond calculations written by T. "
"Thorsteinsson and D. L. Cooper (1996–2005)."
msgstr "*CASVB* 是由 T. Thorsteinsson 和 D. L. Cooper（1996–2005）编写的用于价键计算的通用程序。"

msgid ""
"T. Thorsteinsson, D. L. Cooper, J. Gerratt, P. B. Karadakov and M. Raimondi,"
" `Theor. Chim. Acta <https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s002140050158>`__ **93**, "
"343–366 (1996). D. L. Cooper, T. Thorsteinsson and J. Gerratt,\\ `Int. J. "
"Quantum Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-461X(1997)65:5%3C439::AID-"
"QUA8%3E3.0.CO;2-X>`__ **65**, 439−451 (1997). D.L. Cooper, T. Thorsteinsson "
"and J. Gerratt, `Adv. Quantum Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0065-3276(08)60406-2>`__ **32**, 51-67 (1998)."
msgstr ""
"T. Thorsteinsson, D. L. Cooper, J. Gerratt, P. B. Karadakov and M. Raimondi,"
" `Theor. Chim. Acta <https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s002140050158>`__ **93**, "
"343–366 (1996). D. L. Cooper, T. Thorsteinsson and J. Gerratt,\\ `Int. J. "
"Quantum Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-461X(1997)65:5%3C439::AID-"
"QUA8%3E3.0.CO;2-X>`__ **65**, 439−451 (1997). D.L. Cooper, T. Thorsteinsson "
"and J. Gerratt, `Adv. Quantum Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0065-3276(08)60406-2>`__ **32**, 51-67 (1998)."

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from use of this program should acknowledge "
"relevant publications. There is a somewhat more complete *CASVB* "
"bibliography at `https://pcwww.liv.ac.uk/~dlc/CASVB/ "
"<https://pcwww.liv.ac.uk/~dlc/CASVB/>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用本程序产生的所有发表成果均应致谢相关文献。在 `https://pcwww.liv.ac.uk/~dlc/CASVB/ "
"<https://pcwww.liv.ac.uk/~dlc/CASVB/>`__ 处可以找到一份较为完整的 *CASVB* 参考文献目录。"

msgid "``VBDUMP[,vbdump]``"
msgstr "``VBDUMP[,vbdump]``"

msgid ""
"Wavefunction definitions may be restored here using ``VBDUMP`` cards (see "
"also Section `saving wavefunction information for CASVB "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-wavefunction-information-for-"
"casvb>`__). The default record name (*vbdump*) is 4299.2. If a ``VBDUMP`` "
"card is not present and record 4299.2 does not exist, then *CASVB* will "
"attempt to generate the wavefunction information automatically based on the "
"latest MCSCF calculation (however, ``STATE`` and ``WEIGHT`` information will"
" not be restored in such a case)."
msgstr ""
"可以在此处使用 ``VBDUMP`` 卡片恢复波函数定义（另见 `保存 CASVB 的波函数信息 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-wavefunction-information-for-casvb>`__ "
"一节）。默认记录名（\\ *vbdump*\\ ）为 4299.2。如果不存在 ``VBDUMP`` 卡片且记录 4299.2 不存在，则 "
"*CASVB* 将尝试基于最近的 MCSCF 计算自动生成波函数信息（不过，在这种情况下 ``STATE`` 和 ``WEIGHT`` "
"信息将不会被恢复）。"

msgid "``CON,$n_1,n_2,n_3,n_4,\\ldots$;``"
msgstr "``CON,$n_1,n_2,n_3,n_4,\\ldots$;``"

msgid ""
"Multiple configurations are most likely to be used for SCGVB(*N*,\\ *M*) "
"calculations -- see for example: P. B. Karadakov, D. L. Cooper, B. J. Duke "
"and J. Li, `J. Phys. Chem. A <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jp303998h>`__ "
"**116**, 7238-7244 (2012); P. B. Karadakov and D. L. Cooper. `Theor. Chem. "
"Acc. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00214-013-1421-1>`__ **133**, 1421-1426 "
"(2014)."
msgstr ""
"多组态最有可能用于 SCGVB(*N*,\\ *M*) 计算——例如参见：P. B. Karadakov, D. L. Cooper, B. J. "
"Duke and J. Li, `J. Phys. Chem. A <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/jp303998h>`__ "
"**116**, 7238-7244 (2012); P. B. Karadakov and D. L. Cooper. `Theor. Chem. "
"Acc. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00214-013-1421-1>`__ **133**, 1421-1426 "
"(2014)."

msgid "``SPINBASIS,key;``"
msgstr "``SPINBASIS,key;``"

msgid ""
"*key* may be chosen from ``KOTANI`` (default), ``RUMER``, ``PROJECT`` or "
"``LTRUMER``, specifying the basis of spin eigenfunctions used in the "
"definition of valence bond structures. ``PROJECT`` refers to spin functions "
"generated using a particular spin projection operator (see: B. Friis-Jensen,"
" D.L. Cooper and S. Rettrup, `Theor. Chem. Acc. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s002140050304>`__ **99**, 64-67 (1998)), "
"``LTRUMER`` to Rumer functions with the so-called “leading term\" phase "
"convention."
msgstr ""
"*key* 可从 ``KOTANI``\\ （默认）、\\ ``RUMER``\\ 、\\ ``PROJECT`` 或 ``LTRUMER`` "
"中选择，用于指定价键结构定义中所使用的自旋本征函数基。\\ ``PROJECT`` 指使用特定自旋投影算符生成的自旋函数（参见：B. Friis-"
"Jensen, D.L. Cooper and S. Rettrup, `Theor. Chem. Acc. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s002140050304>`__ **99**, 64-67 (1998)），\\ "
"``LTRUMER`` 指采用所谓“首项”相位约定的 Rumer 函数。"

msgid "``START,ci,vb,orb,trnint;[casvb:trnint]``"
msgstr "``START,ci,vb,orb,trnint;[casvb:trnint]``"

msgid ""
"*ci:* record name for the CASSCF CI vector. The CI vector must have been "
"dumped previously using either of the ``SAVE, NATORB, CANONICAL,`` or "
"``LOCALI`` directives (see section `saving the CI vectors and information "
"for a gradient calculation <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-"
"vectors-and-information-for-a-gradient-calculation>`__). A default value for"
" *ci* is determined from the most recent *vbdump* record(s)."
msgstr ""
"*ci:* CASSCF CI 向量的记录名。该 CI 向量必须事先使用 ``SAVE, NATORB, CANONICAL,`` 或 "
"``LOCALI`` 指令之一已转储（见 `保存 CI 向量和梯度计算所需信息 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#saving-the-ci-vectors-and-information-for-a-"
"gradient-calculation>`__ 一节）。\\ *ci* 的默认值由最近的 *vbdump* 记录确定。"

msgid "``SAVE,vb,civb;``"
msgstr "``SAVE,vb,civb;``"

msgid "``GUESS;key-1,…;key-2,…;…``"
msgstr "``GUESS;key-1,…;key-2,…;…``"

msgid "``ORB,i, c$_1$, c$_2$,…c$_{mact}$;``"
msgstr "``ORB,i, c$_1$, c$_2$,…c$_{mact}$;``"

msgid "``STRUC,c$_1$, c$_2$,…c$_{NVB}$;``"
msgstr "``STRUC,c$_1$, c$_2$,…c$_{NVB}$;``"

msgid ""
"In this way a subset of orbitals and/or structure coefficients may be picked"
" out from a previous calculation. Renumbering of orbitals or structures can "
"be done using the “\\ ``AS``\" construct as outlined above. If the VB "
"wavefunction was previously saved in the AO basis, the orbitals will be "
"projected onto the present active space (note that it is necessary to "
"specify a record name for the molecular orbitals (*orb* in the ``START`` "
"command) for this to be possible)."
msgstr ""
"通过这种方式，可以从先前的计算中挑选出轨道和/或结构系数的子集。轨道或结构的重新编号可以使用上面概述的“\\ ``AS``\\ ”构造来完成。如果 VB"
" 波函数先前保存在 AO 基下，则轨道将被投影到当前活性空间上（注意，为此必须为分子轨道指定记录名，即 ``START`` 命令中的 *orb*\\ "
"）。"

msgid "``ORBPERM,$i_1$,…,$i_{mact}$;``"
msgstr "``ORBPERM,$i_1$,…,$i_{mact}$;``"

msgid "``CRIT,method;``"
msgstr "``CRIT,method;``"

msgid "``MAXITER,$N_{iter}$;``"
msgstr "``MAXITER,$N_{iter}$;``"

msgid "``(NO)CASPROJ;``"
msgstr "``(NO)CASPROJ;``"

msgid "``SADDLE,n;``"
msgstr "``SADDLE,n;``"

msgid "``OPTIM[;…;FINOPTIM];``"
msgstr "``OPTIM[;…;FINOPTIM];``"

msgid "``ALTERN,Niter;…;FINALTERN``"
msgstr "``ALTERN,Niter;…;FINALTERN``"

msgid "``SYMELM,label,sign;``"
msgstr "``SYMELM,label,sign;``"

msgid "``IRREPS,i$_1$, i$_2$,…;``"
msgstr "``IRREPS,i$_1$, i$_2$,…;``"

msgid ""
"The list *i:math:`_1`, i:math:`_2`,…* specifies which irreducible "
"representations (as defined in the CASSCF wavefunction) are antisymmetric "
"with respect to the *label* operation. If an irreducible representation is "
"not otherwise specified it is assumed to be symmetric under the symmetry "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"列表 *i:math:`_1`, i:math:`_2`,…* 指定哪些不可约表示（如 CASSCF 波函数中所定义）关于 *label* "
"操作是反对称的。如果未另行指定某个不可约表示，则假定它在对称操作下是对称的。"

msgid "``COEFFS,i$_1$, i$_2$,…;``"
msgstr "``COEFFS,i$_1$, i$_2$,…;``"

msgid ""
"The list *i:math:`_1`, i:math:`_2`,…* specifies which individual CASSCF MOs "
"are antisymmetric with respect to the *label* operation. If an MO is not "
"otherwise specified, it is assumed to be symmetric under the symmetry "
"operation. This specification may be useful if, for example, the molecule "
"possesses symmetry higher than that exploited in the CASSCF calculation."
msgstr ""
"列表 *i:math:`_1`, i:math:`_2`,…* 指定哪些单个 CASSCF 分子轨道关于 *label* "
"操作是反对称的。如果未另行指定某个分子轨道，则假定它在对称操作下是对称的。例如，当分子具有比 CASSCF "
"计算中所利用的更高的对称性时，此说明可能有用。"

msgid ""
"``TRANS,n$_{dim}$, i$_1$, …i$_{n_{dim}}$, c$_{11}$, c$_{12}$, "
"…c$_{n_{dim}n_{dim}}$;``"
msgstr ""
"``TRANS,n$_{dim}$, i$_1$, …i$_{n_{dim}}$, c$_{11}$, c$_{12}$, "
"…c$_{n_{dim}n_{dim}}$;``"

msgid ""
"Specifies a general n\\ :math:`_{dim}\\times n_{dim}` transformation "
"involving the MOs *i:math:`_1`, …i:math:`_{n_{dim}}`*, specified by the "
":math:`c` coefficients. This may be useful for systems with a two- or three-"
"dimensional irreducible representation, or if localized orbitals define the "
"CASSCF wavefunction. Note that the specified transformation must always be "
"orthogonal."
msgstr ""
"指定一个涉及分子轨道 *i:math:`_1`, …i:math:`_{n_{dim}}`* 的一般 n\\ :math:`_{dim}\\times "
"n_{dim}` 变换，由 :math:`c` 系数给出。这对于具有二维或三维不可约表示的系统，或者当定域轨道定义 CASSCF "
"波函数时可能有用。注意，所指定的变换必须始终是正交的。"

msgid "``ORBREL,i$_1$, i$_2$, label1, label2,…;``"
msgstr "``ORBREL,i$_1$, i$_2$, label1, label2,…;``"

msgid "``(NO)SYMPROJ[,irrep$_1$,irrep$_2$,…];``"
msgstr "``(NO)SYMPROJ[,irrep$_1$,irrep$_2$,…];``"

msgid ""
"``FIXORB``,\\ *i:math:`_1`,i:math:`_2`*,[``TO``,\\ *i:math:`_3`*,]\\ "
"*i:math:`_4`*,…;"
msgstr ""
"``FIXORB``,\\ *i:math:`_1`,i:math:`_2`*,[``TO``,\\ *i:math:`_3`*,]\\ "
"*i:math:`_4`*,…;"

msgid ""
"``FIXSTRUC``,\\ *i:math:`_1`,i:math:`_2`*,[``TO``,\\ *i:math:`_3`*,]\\ "
"*i:math:`_4`*,…;"
msgstr ""
"``FIXSTRUC``,\\ *i:math:`_1`,i:math:`_2`*,[``TO``,\\ *i:math:`_3`*,]\\ "
"*i:math:`_4`*,…;"

msgid ""
"``DELSTRUC``,\\ *i:math:`_1`,i:math:`_2`*,[``TO``,\\ *i:math:`_3`*,]\\ "
"*i:math:`_4`*,…;"
msgstr ""
"``DELSTRUC``,\\ *i:math:`_1`,i:math:`_2`*,[``TO``,\\ *i:math:`_3`*,]\\ "
"*i:math:`_4`*,…;"

msgid "``ORTHCON;key-1,…;key-2,…;…``"
msgstr "``ORTHCON;key-1,…;key-2,…;…``"

msgid "``ORTH,i$_1$, i$_2$, …;``"
msgstr "``ORTH,i$_1$, i$_2$, …;``"

msgid "``PAIRS,i$_1$, i$_2$, …;``"
msgstr "``PAIRS,i$_1$, i$_2$, …;``"

msgid "``GROUP,label,i$_1$, i$_2$, …;``"
msgstr "``GROUP,label,i$_1$, i$_2$, …;``"

msgid ""
"Defines an orbital group to be used with the ``ORTH`` or ``PAIRS`` keyword. "
"The group is referred to by *label* which can be any three characters "
"beginning with a letter a–z. Labels defining different groups can be used "
"together or in combination with orbital numbers in ``ORTH`` or ``PAIRS``. "
"*i:math:`_1`, i:math:`_2`, …* specifies the list of orbitals in the group. "
"Thus the combination ``GROUP``,AZZ,1,2; ``GROUP``,BZZ,3,4; ``ORTH``,AZZ,BZZ;"
" will orthogonalize the pairs of orbitals 1-3, 1-4, 2-3 and 2-4."
msgstr ""
"定义与\\ ``ORTH``\\ 或\\ ``PAIRS``\\ 关键字一起使用的轨道组。该组由\\ *label*\\ 引用，\\ *label*\\"
" 可以是任何以字母a–z开头的三个字符。定义不同组的标签可以一起使用，也可以与\\ ``ORTH``\\ 或\\ ``PAIRS``\\ "
"中的轨道编号组合使用。\\ *i:math:`_1`, i:math:`_2`, …*\\ 指定组中的轨道列表。因此，组合\\ "
"``GROUP``,AZZ,1,2; ``GROUP``,BZZ,3,4; "
"``ORTH``,AZZ,BZZ;将正交化轨道对1-3、1-4、2-3和2-4。"

msgid "``STRONG;``"
msgstr "``STRONG;``"

msgid ""
"This keyword is short-hand for strong orthogonality. The only allowed non-"
"zero overlaps are between pairs of orbitals ($2n"
msgstr "此关键字是强正交性的简写。唯一允许的非零重叠是轨道对之间（$2n"

msgid "-"
msgstr "-"

msgid "1\\ :math:`,`\\ 2n$)."
msgstr "1\\ :math:`,`\\ 2n$）。"

msgid "``FULL;``"
msgstr "``FULL;``"

msgid "``(NO)SCORR;``"
msgstr "``(NO)SCORR;``"

msgid ""
"With this option, expectation values of the spin operators "
":math:`(\\hat{s}_\\mu+\\hat{s}_\\nu)^2` are evaluated for all pairs of "
":math:`\\mu` and :math:`\\nu`. Default is ``NOSCORR``. The procedure is "
"described by: G. Raos, J. Gerratt, D. L. Cooper and M. Raimondi, `Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0301-0104(94)00177-4>`__ **186**, 233–250 "
"(1994); `ibid <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0301-0104(94)00178-2>`__, 251–273 "
"(1994); D. L. Cooper, R. Ponec, T. Thorsteinsson and G. Raos, `Int. J. "
"Quant. Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-461X(1996)57:3%3C501::AID-"
"QUA24%3E3.0.CO;2-4>`__ **57**, 501–518 (1996)."
msgstr ""
"With this option, expectation values of the spin operators "
":math:`(\\hat{s}_\\mu+\\hat{s}_\\nu)^2` are evaluated for all pairs of "
":math:`\\mu` and :math:`\\nu`. Default is ``NOSCORR``. The procedure is "
"described by: G. Raos, J. Gerratt, D. L. Cooper and M. Raimondi, `Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0301-0104(94)00177-4>`__ **186**, 233–250 "
"(1994); `ibid <https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0301-0104(94)00178-2>`__, 251–273 "
"(1994); D. L. Cooper, R. Ponec, T. Thorsteinsson and G. Raos, `Int. J. "
"Quant. Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-461X(1996)57:3%3C501::AID-"
"QUA24%3E3.0.CO;2-4>`__ **57**, 501–518 (1996)."

msgid "``VBWEIGHTS,key1,key2,…``"
msgstr "``VBWEIGHTS,key1,key2,…``"

msgid ""
"``INVERSE`` Outputs “inverse overlap populations\" as in G. A. Gallup and J."
" M. Norbeck, `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(73)80292-1>`__ **21**, 495–500 (1973)."
msgstr ""
"``INVERSE``\\ 输出“逆重叠布居”（inverse overlap populations），如G. A. Gallup和J. M. "
"Norbeck所述，\\ `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/0009-2614(73)80292-1>`__ **21**, 495–500 (1973)。"

msgid "``CIWEIGHTS,key1,key2,…[,$N_{\\rm conf}$];``"
msgstr "``CIWEIGHTS,key1,key2,…[,$N_{\\rm conf}$];``"

msgid "``PRINT,i$_1$, i$_2$,…;``"
msgstr "``PRINT,i$_1$, i$_2$,…;``"

msgid "**0** Minimal output."
msgstr "**0** 最小输出。"

msgid "**1** Standard level of output."
msgstr "**1** 标准输出级别。"

msgid "**2** Extra output."
msgstr "**2** 额外输出。"

msgid ":math:`i_1` Print of input parameters, wavefunction definitions, etc."
msgstr ":math:`i_1` 打印输入参数、波函数定义等。"

msgid ":math:`i_2` Print of information associated with symmetry constraints."
msgstr ":math:`i_2` 打印与对称性约束相关的信息。"

msgid ":math:`i_3` General convergence progress."
msgstr ":math:`i_3` 一般收敛进度。"

msgid ":math:`i_4` Progress of the 2nd order optimization procedure."
msgstr ":math:`i_4` 二阶优化过程的进度。"

msgid ":math:`i_5` Print of converged solution and analysis."
msgstr ":math:`i_5` 打印收敛解及分析。"

msgid ":math:`i_6` Progress of variational optimization."
msgstr ":math:`i_6` 变分优化的进度。"

msgid ":math:`i_7` Usage of record numbers on file 2."
msgstr ":math:`i_7` 文件2上记录号的使用情况。"

msgid ""
"For all, the default output level is +1. If :math:`i_5\\geq`\\ 2 VB orbitals"
" will be printed in the AO basis (provided that the definition of MOs is "
"available); such output may be especially useful for plotting of orbitals."
msgstr ""
"对于所有情况，默认输出级别为 +1。如果 :math:`i_5\\geq`\\ 2，VB 轨道将以 AO "
"基组形式打印（前提是分子轨道的定义可用）；这种输出对于轨道绘图可能特别有用。"

msgid ""
"``SERVICE;\\\\`` This keyword takes precedence over any others previously "
"defined to *CASVB*. It provides simple facilities for retrieving orbital "
"coefficients and VB structure coefficients. It should not be used during a "
"run of *CASVB* that has been invoked from inside *MULTI*."
msgstr ""
"``SERVICE;\\\\`` 此关键字优先于先前为 *CASVB* 定义的所有其他关键字。它提供简单的功能来检索轨道系数和 VB 结构系数。在从 "
"*MULTI* 内部调用的 *CASVB* 运行期间不应使用它。"

msgid ""
"``START,record.file;\\\\`` Coefficients are taken from *record.file*. The "
"default value is *2100.2*."
msgstr "``START,record.file;\\\\`` 系数取自 *record.file*\\ 。默认值为 *2100.2*\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``WRITE,iwrite;\\\\`` Vectors in the symmetry orbital basis are written to "
"channel *iabs(iwrite)*. The default action is to write these vectors to the "
"standard output. If *iwrite* is negative, then the vectors are instead "
"written to a binary file as a single record."
msgstr ""
"``WRITE,iwrite;\\\\`` 对称性轨道基组中的向量被写入通道 *iabs(iwrite)*\\ 。默认操作是将这些向量写入标准输出。如果"
" *iwrite* 为负，则这些向量改为作为单一记录写入二进制文件。"

msgid ""
"``SPECIAL,idim1,idim2,idim3,idim4;\\\\`` If present, this keyword must come "
"last. The program attempts to retrieve from *record.file* a vector of length"
" *idim1\\*idim2+idim3*, after first skipping *idim4* elements. The vector is"
" written according to the setting of *iwrite*. (Default *idim* values are "
"zero.)"
msgstr ""
"``SPECIAL,idim1,idim2,idim3,idim4;\\\\`` 如果存在，此关键字必须放在最后。程序尝试从 *record.file*"
" 中检索长度为 *idim1\\*\\ idim2+idim3\\ * 的向量，在此之前先跳过 *\\ idim4\\ * 个元素。向量根据 *\\ "
"iwrite\\ * 的设置写入。（默认 *\\ idim* 值为零。）"
